{
  "_comment": [
    "Composite indexes for the queries in store.js. Single-field indexes are",
    "created automatically by Firestore and are not listed here.",
    "Deploy with: firebase deploy --only firestore:indexes",
    "",
    "Each entry maps to one role's scoped query — see scopeClause() in store.js."
